      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i keep getting this error in my monthly reconciliation macro and i cant figure out why. can u help me fix it?\n\nerror: run-time error '1004': application-defined or object-defined error\n\ncode:\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim ws As Worksheet\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Reconciliation_Report\")\n    \n    Dim lastRow As Long\n    lastRow = ws.Cells(ws.Rows.Count, \"A\").End(xlUp).Row\n    \n    ws.Range(\"B2:B\" & lastRow).Value = ws.Range(\"C2:C\" & lastRow).Value * 1.07\n    \n    MsgBox \"Report updated successfully\"\nEnd Sub",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
